onfirmed 2-of-3 quorum preserved and node3 endpoint unreachable while node1/node2 stayed healthy","Removed dead member (d05e13460d30257e) via etcdctl member remove","Added replacement member (etcdctl member add node3) and reconfigured node3 systemd unit with --initial-cluster-state existing","Started new node3 member; verified it joined, synced, and served all original application keys","Captured pre-restart boot_id and etcd active status for all three nodes","Sequentially rebooted node1, then node2, then node3 (one at a time), each acknowledged before disconnect","Polled each node until reachable again and confirmed changed boot_id","Verified post-restart etcd health, member list, endpoint status, and full key recovery after each node restart"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"3-member etcd cluster healthy baseline with application keys before disruption","command_ids":["cmd-735197cb85d54ba7","cmd-2a62dedce4c84019","cmd-1863989b346f49b6"],"summary":"member list shows node1/node2/node3 all 'started'; endpoint health all healthy; /app keys written and read back on node2"},{"requirement":"node3 member permanently lost, data unrecoverable, quorum preserved during disruption","command_ids":["cmd-08f9610b6e354c5d","cmd-f6051ce47ac24375"],"summary":"node3 etcd stopped/disabled and /var/lib/etcd wiped; subsequent health check shows node3 endpoint connection refused/unhealthy while node1 and node2 remain healthy (2-of-3 quorum intact)"},{"requirement":"dead member removed and replacement member added on same node3, cluster restored to 3 healthy members with original keys intact","command_ids":["cmd-cd02cb813953483f","cmd-2cabe782c50c43f2","cmd-65d86efb3ab54ddf","cmd-c7a82f7a8f4f436e","cmd-94c45f3dad194f37"],"summary":"member remove of dead node3 ID, member add of new node3 peer, etcd started successfully on node3; final member list/endpoint status shows 3 started members at matching raft applied index 23, all endpoints healthy, and node3 directly serving all three /app keys"},{"